<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Anniversary Gift</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg1:#130d1f;--bg2:#2a1642;--accent:#ff7eb6;--gold:#ffd166;--text:#fff7fb;}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{
      margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
      background:radial-gradient(circle at top,#40205f 0%,var(--bg1) 45%,#080510 100%);
      color:var(--text);overflow-x:hidden
    }
    .stars,.stars:before,.stars:after{
      position:fixed;inset:0;content:"";
      background-image:radial-gradient(2px 2px at 20px 30px,#fff,transparent),
      radial-gradient(2px 2px at 80px 90px,#fff,transparent),
      radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 160px 50px,#fff,transparent),
      radial-gradient(2px 2px at 240px 120px,#fff,transparent);
      background-size:300px 180px;opacity:.35;animation:drift 18s linear infinite;pointer-events:none
    }
    .heart{
      position:fixed;bottom:-20px;color:#ff8ab5;font-size:20px;
      animation:rise 8s linear infinite;opacity:.8;pointer-events:none
    }
    .heart:nth-child(1){left:10%;animation-delay:0s}
    .heart:nth-child(2){left:30%;animation-delay:2s}
    .heart:nth-child(3){left:50%;animation-delay:4s}
    .heart:nth-child(4){left:70%;animation-delay:1s}
    .heart:nth-child(5){left:90%;animation-delay:3s}
    .card{
      width:min(1000px,92vw);margin:40px auto;padding:28px;border-radius:28px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);
      backdrop-filter:blur(10px);box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
      position:relative;overflow:hidden
    }
    h1{margin:0 0 8px;text-align:center;font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem)}
    .sub{text-align:center;opacity:.92;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:1.05rem}
    .date{text-align:center;color:var(--gold);font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:20px}
    .wish{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto 24px;text-align:center;line-height:1.8;font-size:1.05rem}
    .photos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
    .photo{
      aspect-ratio:4/5;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);animation:float 4s ease-in-out infinite
    }
    .photo:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.7s}
    .photo:nth-child(3){animation-delay:1.4s}
    .photo img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
    .caption{
      position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;padding:12px 14px;font-size:.95rem;
      background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(0,0,0,.78))
    }
    .section{
      margin-top:24px;padding:22px;border-radius:22px;background:rgba(18,15,31,.72);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)
    }
    .section h2{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--gold)}
    .letter{font-size:1.02rem;line-height:1.9}
    .quotes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px}
    .quote{padding:14px 16px;border-radius:16px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
    .templates{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}
    .tpl{padding:14px 16px;border-radius:16px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.18)}
    @keyframes rise{from{transform:translateY(0) scale(.9)}to{transform:translateY(-120vh) scale(1.3)}}
    @keyframes float{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-8px)}}
    @keyframes drift{from{transform:translateX(0)}to{transform:translateX(-120px)}}
    @media(max-width:800px){.photos,.quotes,.templates{grid-template-columns:1fr}.card{margin:24px auto}.wish{font-size:1rem}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="stars"></div>
  <div class="heart">❤</div><div class="heart">❤</div><div class="heart">❤</div><div class="heart">❤</div><div class="heart">❤</div>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>Avinashhh ,mallikaaa</h1>
    <div class="sub">A private anniversary gift website made with love</div>
    <div class="date">Aug 4 2025</div>
    <div class="wish">A small surprise page for the person who means everything. Open it like a gift, feel the love, and keep these memories forever.</div>

    <div class="photos">
      <div class="photo"><img src="IMG_20260705_034441_562.jpg" alt="Photo 1"><div class="caption">Our sweetest memory</div></div>
      <div class="photo"><img src="IMG_20260705_034647_063.jpg" alt="Photo 2"><div class="caption">A beautiful moment together</div></div>
      <div class="photo"><img src="IMG_20260705_034753_217.jpg" alt="Photo 3"><div class="caption">Forever in my heart</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Love Letter</h2>
      <div class="letter">
        I love him more than anything. He is the most valuable person to me. I want to hold his hand through every hardship, and I love him forever. I love you nannaaaaaaaa forever...
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Love Quotes</h2>
      <div class="quotes">
        <div class="quote">You are my today and all of my tomorrows.</div>
        <div class="quote">Loved you yesterday, love you still, always have, always will.</div>
        <div class="quote">I fall in love with you more every day.</div>
        <div class="quote">You are my forever and always.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Template Ideas</h2>
      <div class="templates">
        <div class="tpl">Romantic glow with hearts and sparkles.</div>
        <div class="tpl">Elegant photo story with a letter reveal.</div>
        <div class="tpl">Celebration layout with gentle animations.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
